+ d(b, e) − d(a, b) − d(c, e) and stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when no change is below −1e-8. The tour is JGraphT’s exactly on integers, and on floating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weights whose sums are exactly representable (dyadic values of moderate size); otherwise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rounding and the threshold can pick other moves, so the tours may differ."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph is complete; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tour.vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists every vertex of the graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly once; no weight is NaN or infinite; the sum of any two weights fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"W"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n²) per improving move."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph\/twoopttour(improving:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/twoOptTour(improving:weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"code":"tour","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" improved by 2-opt to a 2-optimal tour, by JGraphT","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"TwoOptHeuristicTSP.improveTour","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"‘s procedure: best improvement, the first move (i, j) in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row-major order on ties, until no exchange of two tour edges for two lighter ones remains.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"LEMON’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Opt2Tsp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shares the n